Follow [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) as canonical policy and read `docs/PROJECT_STATE.md`, `docs/NEXT_ACTION.md`, `docs/BACKLOG.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md`, and `docs/HANDOFF.md` before changes. `AI_Native_Multi_Hosting_Master_Prompt.md` is the governing charter.

All work stays in `Vertex-Systems-Network/vsn-orbicore` via GitHub. Create a feature branch from current `main`, edit remotely, verify with GitHub Actions, inspect the PR diff/checks, and merge only after success. Do not clone or create local-only changes. If a required remote operation is unavailable, record the exact blocker and stop at the last remote checkpoint. Never claim mock data proves live provider behavior or perform production actions without scoped authorization.
